{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TechnoRunner</strong> is an indie Arcade game, mixing Rythm game and Endless Runner, set in procedurally generated levels. Compete on a global leaderboard or against your friends for the highest score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music sets the pace! Move in the rythm, and take as many risks as possible to unlock combo chains. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The walls are procedurally generated, increasing difficulty with time. Can you reach the end of a song?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was carefully crafted by a solo indie developer. And he hopes you like it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also available for FREE on Android : search &quot;TechnoRunner&quot; on Google Play Store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made in Unreal Engine 5</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Educated","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454930/16933ef9d75275ec223ae288a4f3d0082b1e02aa.jpg"},{"name":"Maximum Tryhard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454930/8af6b96f39a66b2bb22a68dd00fb2b52c5adcc67.jpg"},{"name":"A good start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454930/efa9d2abd4e0f5187965ad836b92cabf87462267.jpg"},{"name":"A better start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454930/c42d9814b28d80f3ba9d34d9986fee100ec6c320.jpg"},{"name":"6 digits!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454930/37f4423b73906fd8edbe064e118f0d6f6058c662.jpg"},{"name":"Confirmed Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454930/56ca4d193d343ecf9e4feb64c196d05a8e7ff3c6.jpg"},{"name":"Halfway there...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1454930/f66afb23820571c9c605208f5cae89d7f233671f.jpg"},{"name":"Almost There...","pa